OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMassive hope for pancreatic cancer pill
OL,4,Aafter trial saw tumours vanish
OL,5,
OL,6,FTumours stopped growing in almost all
OL,7,Fof the 61 participants who had recently
OL,8,Fbeen diagnosed with advanced pancreatic
OL,9,Fcancer that had spread to other parts
OL,10,Fof the body.
OL,12,FBut doctors stress it is a long way
OL,13,Ffrom knowing how long it might keep the
OL,14,Fdisease at bay and should not be seen
OL,15,Fas a cure.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
